    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MISS CLAVEL: Where is she, Aggie?\nAGGIE: Well, it’s her hat, Miss. Clavel... Seems it ran away from her again.\nMISS CLAVEL: Madeline!\nMADELINE: Gotcha!",
      "MADELINE: Last time, I promise, Miss Clavel. It just seems like this hat has a mind of its own sometimes.\nMISS CLAVEL: Yes, Madeline. You and your hat must have much to talk about then. Come along. To the Louvre we go. Monsieur Delacroix awaits us...",
      "MISS CLAVEL: Madeline!\nMADELINE: Yikes. Gotta go.",
      "MISS CLAVEL: Are you alright, Madeline?\nMADELINE: I don’t know... I feel strange...\nMISS CLAVEL: Well, you’ll go to bed, get a good night ’s sleep, and everything will be right in the morning.\nMADELINE: It got this feeling like the whole world’s about to change... Like something’s gonna explode... You ever feel that way, Miss Clavel?",
      "AGGIE: Are you alright, Madeline?\nMADELINE: Owww... I feel like there’s all these crocodiles in my tummy... Ow! Maybe it’s something I ate...\nAGGIE: But we all ate the same thing!"
    ]
  },
